WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Everyone. Today, the sixth discipline is born.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The fifth one was last week. Already?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
That one's legacy now. More agents, more disciplines.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Look. This is a loop. Read the output, run it again.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Then that's graph engineering. That's harness. Plant more signposts.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The names keep multiplying. The drawing hasn't changed.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
My disciplines. All six of them, gone.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The signposts washed away. This thing is still running.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The name will change again next year. This one lives in our room.

